{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54128","headline":"日泊 · 蒋琰","name":"日泊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁惜光阴似惜金，十年湖海已投簪。\n於今雨屋（《安州诗录》作「屋雨」）青灯夜，消尽风尘未了心。\n（见清戚鹤泉编《三台诗录》卷一。\n张靖龙云见清王魏胜《安州诗录》卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋琰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}